{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30012_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3fc4182b6af0efee73fec2287564c9c4a4a41e76e40f6ebd4c8c638872ccc352",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9abf44377a36f9fae5a2b49a43ab37a3422db5e8fe54d9c7a0fdbfc7560ab332",
      "text": "（唉……结果，还是硬着头皮答应下来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3590ffe3ef47a98f111aee99dcd5ecbba7721a2bea233a5fd0e9694e232d05d",
      "text": "（每一次，都是这样。\n总是没法把自己的想法好好说出口）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84afa8f4b08514e91623c1bc2ff3372e6b77689f2102a2ac1ae205acfeb9b0ff",
      "text": "（这次的工作也是一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c764b55b8a456d2379e95e444eb31418a10e441ac6c6b002c7e48460decea0f1",
      "text": "（●●●●プロデューサー虽然说我做得很好，\n但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dadd941b21e4a256eb45f7d2483c91fcaf6081c3f451adf4cd0deb5e4005fca7",
      "text": "（我真的，有好好做好吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9880bd9dee73c09c8a08d858a95edbed08e49c5591f865ec9d719e58b9a7069",
      "text": "（赛跑的时候，也是多亏了志狼君\n总算撑过去了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:447493b062149cc8f4422898ec3072bf40011348be285a4cd1fb2ddcedd095fa",
      "text": "（在兔子公园那次，也是因为花音君说了很多话，\n现场才热闹起来的对吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5fcd0c75132cf95a571b9dcda1c478e8cd1d106e4d41136cbe6ac66617dc415",
      "text": "（相比之下我呢，在将棋那次也是\n紧张得没办法顺畅地表达……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2038f9481f15830ee6711e8c1bb8c4d36030c51cde686d772e9d1d871d2abd75",
      "text": "（……想改变爱哭的自己，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e78065eca47b62a56e20bf0fad4226f28619087eb4ef9fe77d8f98c44eb3409",
      "text": "（我虽然很想回答他，其实做现在的自己就已经很好了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2f5b5105e94c0dd4f4f6c04babe2cc3408a08dcb858000d3ca140d11970173",
      "text": "（可是，连我都在为自己缺乏自信而苦恼，\n根本没办法挺起胸膛这么说啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f090702aca5cf4eab962229816659dd4b34ee4e80b292b9ce16cf280ad8ba7",
      "text": "……找大家商量一下，应该可以吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000171:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69baa00b365241d19d2f2948b1f8335b8957da94ca0494715823bca41145e51c",
      "text": "突然打扰非常抱歉。\n请问现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000173:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8ab65d5bf59e73715eb445fdbfc0d1c4c92ce08eaee4d0df08cfe69e65ce88",
      "text": "发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000173:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12dd40629e8542209b43074cbaaee8aaffe29db9c78b22b2871b040a59ccd479",
      "text": "嗯，方便的哦。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b3532573f1401a6a2f38404f372f51d5d8993e151bf8a3c3959a2462d3d199",
      "text": "直央君，怎么啦？\n是很重要的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a2972932189f8b8084a5c17002d86eb283226a971688b21b5e4fe0c3dc30d6",
      "text": "有件事，想找大家\n商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90a62bc113d62fbf678b464d4e57a086ef0b5704e1877de73276253e3d5bb37",
      "text": "什么事啊？\n你想商量的事情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c4363ce467f6a2d2030f6b9aa02234bc219a80f3a36d09bfe9100bba8da97b4",
      "text": "在LINK上不太容易说清楚，\n所以，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59e7edc820cbfd868eba33c24f89c3a6912c2c6e5e69053cf855b52541de47d",
      "text": "明天，大家可以在事务所\n当面聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000186:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000186:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53ba4e1e42ffd949dc7b50519ded971dd6f0cfefc0511d1f6faf8cc75fbb632",
      "text": "明白了！那么明天，\n我们抽时间聚一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000189:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d960f761ac63bfcf1e527d4426cbbfa8a06705b1ea100c0565dcde9d7e5e749",
      "text": "好！\n花音也有空哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000191:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4639c9f9eceab42f6016f27490ce5aa8395590522ab731bba8569f8662cf604",
      "text": "真是拿你没办法啊！\n那本大爷就稍微抽点时间\n陪你一下吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_h:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d9269dc441f9f57f8d1daff24fa4c7359046c6ef6063b5021e469bf751d5f8",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n制作人，\n明天也拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
